# The arranger in the simulator: a fixed seed, a style, the energy held down, and all of it repeats.
# (Auto: the arranger leads, saved with the piece, as it boots: the top of the song. Hands, the default, is hands.amb's)
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
tap SAVE
wait 800
reboot
master 2430
expect style 0
expect section 0
expect level 0
expect sixteenths >0
tap PLAY
wait 200
seed 1234
style roller
wait 50
expect style 1
tap PLAY
# the first section, then on: the hats come after the intro's two phrases at most (at most 45 s)
wait 40000
expect playing 1
wait 20000
expect section >0
# energy 0: hats at most from the next bar
energy 0
wait 2000
expect level <2
wait 90000
expect level <2
expect peak_db_max -0.5
# back up: drums again in time
energy 100
breaks 100
wait 120000
expect hits >0
# a stop and a new start: from the top
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect section 0
expect level 0
